WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.001
The head of the

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.235
Wagner mercenary group

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:04.004
admits his forces in Bakhmut

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.106
have been, quote, pretty battered.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:07.173
But Yevgeny Prigozhin

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.575
insists his mercenaries

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.577
have practically destroyed

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.012
the Ukrainian army, again,

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:14.247
those are his claims and continue

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:17.017
he does, saying they will win the battle

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.318
for the eastern city.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.285
Ukrainian officials,

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.253
of course, dispute

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.087
that claim,

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.555
saying they are the ones

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.290
that are keeping control of Bakhmut.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.225
Now, the US believes

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:26.760
there are about 6000

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.560
Wagner mercenaries

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.362
currently fighting there

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.332
and they are suffering serious losses.

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.299
A top U.S.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.567
general is saying Ukrainian

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.301
defense forces

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:35.835
are, quote,

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.470
inflicting a lot of death

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.906
and destruction on those guys.

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:40.807
Ben Wedeman

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:43.376
joins me now from eastern Ukraine.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.677
And Ben, really curious

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:45.645
to get your insights here.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.679
You've been on the ground there

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.814
for a few days.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.282
What more have you learned

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.550
about the state of play,

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.085
especially there in Buck Mount?

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.119
And I know that you've heard

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.087
from both sides

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.088
in terms of each

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:56.222
giving their position

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.223
and sometimes putting

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.258
forward disinformation

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:01.561
Yes.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.695
I mean, seriously, the

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.397
situation is unclear.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.532
Back in January,

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:08.001
we were almost every day in Bermuda.

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:10.270
But since the 21st of February,

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.604
the Ukrainians declared

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.506
Bermuda a red zone.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.642
So volunteers and journalists

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:17.177
simply cannot go there.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:19.279
So I can't tell you firsthand.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.247
But what we are hearing

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.682
is that the Ukrainians

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:26.386
are still controlling perhaps 40%

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:27.654
of the city

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.856
that they have lost some ground

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.925
over the last few weeks.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:34.260
But the Ukrainians insist that the lines

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.830
and their words have stabilized.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:38.965
Now what you have ongoing

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:41.167
there is really it's being called

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.068
a meat grinder

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.837
where you could call it a bloodbath.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:44.270
There are

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.807
heavy casualties on both sides now.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.409
The ratio of dead

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.677
Ukrainians to dead

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.412
Russians, it's not clear.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:55.281
Some put it as much as five dead Russians

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.850
for every one dead

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.718
Ukrainian Others say it's

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:00.720
more like one dead Russian

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.221
or rather

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:03.990
two dead Russians for one Ukrainian.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:07.760
So the battle is intense and certainly

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.162
what we've seen is that

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:12.098
there are many Ukrainian forces

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:15.635
deployed on the outskirts of Borehamwood.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.637
They've dug defensive positions

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:20.073
there's lots of armor in the area.

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.808
So in the event

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.476
the Ukrainians can no longer

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.811
hold back mud,

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.679
they hold the high ground

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.715
to the west of the city

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.550
and they certainly would be able

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.919
to stop a Russian advance there.

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:37.290
It's been really a battle of quantity

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.791
versus quality.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.260
The Russians obviously

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:44.097
have a huge new numerical advantage

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:47.100
and certainly in terms of weaponry

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.302
their weaponry may be antiquated,

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.471
but they have a lot of ammunition,

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.339
which we've heard

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.841
from Ukrainian officials

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:56.543
that they don't seem to be suffering.

00:02:56.543 --> 00:02:57.377
The Russians,

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:58.144
that is

00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:01.381
from a shortage of artillery shells.

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.283
But certainly

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:06.019
the situation is more or less stalemated,

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:08.388
but at a high price to both sides.

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:09.856
Both to both sides.

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:10.823
And we have been hearing that

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:11.558
quite clearly.

00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:12.992
We just went over what U.S.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.594
officials had said.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.329
I wonder what you make of the Wagner

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:17.430
leader for Ghosn.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.431
He admitted, okay,

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:19.866
that they are battered.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:22.035
But what about his claims

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:22.468
that he's

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.137
inflicting great pain on Ukraine

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:26.639
and the fact that he continually gives it

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:27.840
literally gives it

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.242
to the Russian defense ministry

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:30.543
about what he needs on the ground

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:31.778
and what he hasn't gotten on the ground

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:35.615
Well, we've heard him

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:37.584
complain quite publicly time

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:38.785
and time again

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.286
about not receiving

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:41.387
adequate support

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.423
from the Russian defense ministry.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:45.892
And specifically the Russian army.

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:48.795
He's got a feud with those people.

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:51.531
And at the end of the day,

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:54.334
the force that has the resources

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:56.669
is the Russian army.

00:03:56.669 --> 00:04:00.440
And all reports indicate that Wagner,

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:01.274
the Wagner

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:02.642
group, has lost

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:05.078
thousands of its fighters.

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.746
Now, I suggest

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.581
we put that in quotation marks.

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:11.050
Many of them are simply convicts

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:13.987
with very little in the way of training.

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:15.054
And we've been

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:17.123
we've spoken to Ukrainian soldiers

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:19.125
when I was here last January

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:19.792
who said that

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:21.160
they the Russians use

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.862
a very specific tactic.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.964
They will send waves of these

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:26.032
basically cannon

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:27.367
fodder convicts

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:30.570
and others, poorly trained people forward

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.307
to allow for the Ukrainians to open fire.

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:36.576
They expose their firing positions

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:37.343
and then

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:38.811
better trained, better

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.847
equipped Russian troops

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:43.016
will then focus their fire

00:04:43.016 --> 00:04:44.083
on the Ukrainian.

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.452
So it comes at a very high price

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:48.521
to the Wagner group.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:51.791
And but it's also inflicting a high cost

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:53.092
on the Ukrainians.

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:55.128
But Prigozhin, it's

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:55.828
hard to say

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:59.699
how much longer he can carry on with a

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:00.566
this feud

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:03.303
with the Russian military hierarchy

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:06.939
and how much longer his military force

00:05:07.206 --> 00:05:10.343
can go on taking these high losses Paula.

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:13.379
Yeah,
especially what may be to come in terms

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:15.014
of a change to that stalemate

00:05:15.014 --> 00:05:18.584
as spring has now sprung in Ukraine.

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:19.152
Ben Wedeman

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:21.321
for us on the Eastern front lines.

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.055
I appreciate it.

